<task id="024" project="smart-todo-r5">
  <metadata>
    <title>SpaarkeAi widget default orientation = side-by-side columns (FR-09 / U-2)</title>
    <phase>3: Top bar + filter + visuals</phase>
    <gate>003 complete</gate>
    <status>completed</status>
    <rigor>FULL</rigor>
    <rigor-reason>Modifies .tsx default state in the shared SmartTodoWidget — FULL per CLAUDE.md §8 ("modifying .cs/.ts/.tsx" trigger); SpaarkeAi hot-path (per project hot-path declaration).</rigor-reason>
    <model-tier>sonnet</model-tier>
    <model-tier-reason>Single well-understood default-value change with existing regression coverage to extend — not architectural — sonnet default per CLAUDE.md §8.5.</model-tier-reason>
    <effort>high</effort>
    <parallel-group>none</parallel-group>
    <parallel-safe>false</parallel-safe>
    <parallel-reason>Edits src/client/shared/Spaarke.SmartTodo.Components/src/widgets/SmartTodoWidget/SmartTodoWidget.tsx, which task 012 (Phase 2, priority/effort per-card UI) also touches — coordinate to avoid clobbering each other's edits to the same widget file.</parallel-reason>
